<title>HONG KONG: HK provisional Dec-Feb unemployment 2.4 pct.</title>
<headline>HK provisional Dec-Feb unemployment 2.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department gave on Thursday the following seasonally adjusted figures as percentages of the total workforce:</p>
<p>			Dec-Feb*  Nov-Jan   Aug-Oct   Nov-Jan</p>
<p>			1996/97   1996/97   1996	1995/96</p>
<p> Unemployment	2.4	 2.5	 2.5	 3.2</p>
<p> Underemployment   1.2	 1.4	 1.5	 2.4</p>
<p>* = provisional</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
